  "criteria": "Main flow: discovery, intake, enrichment and user decisions. Posting freshness is background maintenance. Enrichment: every scoring and decision input (fit, degree FLEX and evidence, work arrangement, pay range with basis and source, location coordinates, employer, title, products with reference) plus a Writer-calculated final score with model provenance, the same gate as the decision queue; posting freshness is independent background maintenance. Review queue: open and undecided, not a recommendation to apply. Closed postings are separate exits from processing. No canonical bucket changes.",
